      "text": "slays Morianton2, Alma 50:35. defeats army of Amalickiah, Alma 51:29–32. slays Amalickiah, Alma 51:33–34. prepares to battle Lamanites, Alma 52:1–6. is ordered to attack city of Mulek, Alma 52:17–20. decoys Lamanites and scatters them, Alma 52:22–28. sets prisoners to work, Alma 53:3. food sought for Teancum’s army, Alma 61:18 (62:13). Teancum and Lehi3 are given command over remainder of army of Moroni1, Alma 62:3. slays Ammoron and is slain, Alma 62:35–36.",
